WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.020 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 30]

01:42.590 --> 01:43.610
She's seriously injured.

01:44.400 --> 01:45.140
I'm here.

01:45.720 --> 01:46.700
I won't let you die.

01:56.000 --> 01:56.330
You...

01:56.710 --> 01:57.810
Stop hugging me so tightly.

01:58.230 --> 01:59.010
I can't breathe.

02:03.030 --> 02:03.850
My spiritual power...

02:05.030 --> 02:06.210
You're taking my spiritual power.

02:09.640 --> 02:10.540
Wake up!

02:11.390 --> 02:12.260
Wake up!

02:12.750 --> 02:13.730
Wake up!

03:25.590 --> 03:26.210
Five Phases Array.

03:26.590 --> 03:27.020
Now!

03:40.070 --> 03:41.330
Give me something useful.

03:42.070 --> 03:43.130
Hurry.

03:49.150 --> 03:50.370
She bites as well?

03:55.360 --> 03:56.060
Forget it.

03:57.190 --> 03:58.340
Consider this my payment

03:59.470 --> 04:00.780
for what I received from you that day.

04:41.310 --> 04:42.060
It's him?

05:02.000 --> 05:03.060
How come he has no power left?

05:06.310 --> 05:06.850
Oh, no.

05:07.430 --> 05:08.540
As my cultivation core was damaged,

05:09.150 --> 05:10.500
I used Rebirth Art.

05:11.000 --> 05:11.980
I absorb power

05:12.190 --> 05:13.170
from whoever touches me.

05:23.150 --> 05:23.980
This is so embarrassing.

05:24.560 --> 05:25.450
I need to make sure

05:26.000 --> 05:27.660
he doesn't know I did it.

05:28.280 --> 05:28.980
Perhaps

05:29.310 --> 05:30.170
I can run away?

05:33.470 --> 05:34.690
But he did save me.

05:35.710 --> 05:36.890
If he tells everyone...

05:38.190 --> 05:38.690
Whatever.

05:38.910 --> 05:39.660
I'll just kill him later.

05:41.710 --> 05:42.660
He sure

05:43.240 --> 05:45.010
has many artifacts to save his life.

05:46.000 --> 05:47.100
That joke

05:47.400 --> 05:48.380
somehow became a reality.

05:49.520 --> 05:50.340
I wonder

05:50.680 --> 05:51.690
if this is fortune or misfortune

05:52.240 --> 05:53.100
for him.

06:24.950 --> 06:25.410
Master.

06:26.310 --> 06:27.020
Where am I?

06:27.680 --> 06:28.660
Is this a dream?

06:29.430 --> 06:31.900
Don't you always have a way to keep yourself alive?

06:34.040 --> 06:35.490
Why did you get yourself into this state?

06:37.390 --> 06:37.900
Master,

06:38.310 --> 06:38.810
I'm fine.

06:39.240 --> 06:40.220
Stop acting tough.

06:42.680 --> 06:44.610
How old are you again?

06:45.390 --> 06:46.700
You're acting tough like a grandfather.

06:47.270 --> 06:47.780
What if

06:48.310 --> 06:49.460
you can't find a partner because of this?

06:50.950 --> 06:52.290
You don't have a partner either.

06:52.800 --> 06:53.460
Excuse me?

06:55.390 --> 06:56.170
I see you've grown

06:56.310 --> 06:57.220
bold.

06:57.680 --> 06:58.930
I learned it from you.

06:59.270 --> 07:00.290
Brat.

07:02.830 --> 07:03.370
Master.

07:04.120 --> 07:05.410
Who would have known

07:06.120 --> 07:07.490
that the one who understands me the most

07:07.680 --> 07:08.660
would be you?

07:09.510 --> 07:12.100
My last disciple.

07:13.750 --> 07:15.780
Something is bothering you.

07:16.630 --> 07:17.850
Tell me now.

07:18.190 --> 07:19.140
What do you think

07:19.920 --> 07:21.170
is more important

07:21.720 --> 07:22.610
than one's life?

07:26.000 --> 07:27.340
Our cultivators look for enlightenment

07:27.720 --> 07:28.340
to achieve

07:29.040 --> 07:30.460
immortality.

07:36.120 --> 07:37.580
How should I put this?

07:38.430 --> 07:40.020
Everything in this world

07:40.830 --> 07:42.170
has a purpose.

07:42.480 --> 07:44.540
The sun and the moon can exist for eons,

07:45.720 --> 07:47.930
yet tiny creatures live and die within a day.

07:48.870 --> 07:50.370
Enlightenment is formless.

07:51.360 --> 07:53.460
It doesn't have one true answer.

07:55.750 --> 07:57.340
For me,

07:57.430 --> 07:59.410
enlightenment is achieving

07:59.560 --> 08:00.610
true peace with myself.

08:01.360 --> 08:02.460
Fu Yunzi

08:02.800 --> 08:04.540
wants to see good in everything.

08:05.600 --> 08:07.050
Liu Jing

08:07.360 --> 08:09.140
wants absolute justice.

08:10.040 --> 08:12.220
Our enlightenment

08:12.830 --> 08:14.610
is defined by ourselves.

08:19.310 --> 08:20.370
That's why they say if they find

08:21.070 --> 08:21.930
enlightenment in the morning,

08:22.680 --> 08:24.140
they are content to pass away in the same evening.

08:26.920 --> 08:27.850
That's right.

08:29.190 --> 08:30.700
You can enjoy your long life,

08:31.000 --> 08:33.290
but don't lose yourself to time either.

08:34.310 --> 08:37.050
Remember who you are

08:37.510 --> 08:38.660
and your purpose.

08:51.390 --> 08:52.100
Kid,

08:53.870 --> 08:55.980
don't you still have many things to do?

08:57.600 --> 08:59.370
Don't dally here.

09:01.270 --> 09:02.020
Go now.

09:21.720 --> 09:24.220
The world has many breathtaking views.

09:25.000 --> 09:26.370
Do admire them

09:26.600 --> 09:28.290
on behalf of me.

10:38.480 --> 10:39.420
Qi Refining Stage?

11:03.390 --> 11:04.460
What's happening?

11:05.080 --> 11:06.130
Why is this happening?

11:09.000 --> 11:09.850
You're awake.

11:13.270 --> 11:14.010
Senior Nangong.

11:14.240 --> 11:15.100
I saved you.

11:15.630 --> 11:16.890
Why did you take my spiritual power?

11:18.320 --> 11:19.180
What?

11:19.870 --> 11:21.650
Who took your spiritual power?

11:22.390 --> 11:23.610
You, Nangong Wan.

11:24.440 --> 11:25.460
Nangong Wan?

11:28.120 --> 11:29.890
You think I'm Nangong Wan?

11:32.510 --> 11:34.980
You mistook me for my cousin.

11:36.600 --> 11:38.010
I'm not Nangong Wan.

11:41.630 --> 11:42.610
Who are you then?

11:44.120 --> 11:45.220
I am

11:46.240 --> 11:47.530
Nangong

11:49.030 --> 11:49.490
Ping.

11:52.030 --> 11:52.890
Nangong Ping.

11:59.200 --> 12:00.890
You must be the man from Yellow Maple Valley.

12:01.120 --> 12:01.890
Nangong Wan

12:02.000 --> 12:03.010
told me everything.

12:07.270 --> 12:08.130
Every...

12:08.270 --> 12:09.130
Everything?

12:09.870 --> 12:10.340
Yes.

12:10.510 --> 12:11.340
Everything.

12:12.080 --> 12:13.490
Not even a thick book

12:13.510 --> 12:14.940
can contain the sins you've committed.

12:15.630 --> 12:16.980
And the worst thing you did

12:17.480 --> 12:19.180
is to give her an Ageless Pill.

12:19.790 --> 12:20.340
Why?

12:20.550 --> 12:21.980
Are you calling her old?

12:22.600 --> 12:24.530
When I heard that, the first thing that came to my mind

12:24.670 --> 12:27.220
was to capture you and feed you to a spiritual beast.

12:30.150 --> 12:30.940
So you

12:31.150 --> 12:32.460
repaid my kindness with vengeance,

12:33.360 --> 12:34.010
and took away

12:34.200 --> 12:34.820
my spiritual power?

12:36.030 --> 12:37.490
You reap what you sow.

12:38.390 --> 12:39.610
You did bad things

12:39.630 --> 12:40.490
so it's on you.

12:42.750 --> 12:43.850
This is just a lesson.

12:45.750 --> 12:46.820
Don't play

12:47.200 --> 12:48.340
hero again

12:48.870 --> 12:50.180
and save a damsel in distress.

12:55.200 --> 12:56.010
Her family

12:56.030 --> 12:57.340
shares the same

12:58.080 --> 12:58.850
complicated temper.

13:00.720 --> 13:01.650
But she's right.

13:02.480 --> 13:03.650
I can't be reckless.

13:09.150 --> 13:09.700
Senior,

13:10.120 --> 13:11.060
if you're her cousin,

13:12.510 --> 13:13.850
then I suppose by saving her,

13:14.360 --> 13:15.580
I have returned her the favor.

13:16.360 --> 13:17.340
Please put your mind at ease.

13:21.000 --> 13:21.820
But

13:22.870 --> 13:24.180
I'm still a learning cultivator.

13:25.080 --> 13:26.220
Whatever progress I made

13:26.360 --> 13:27.300
is gone.

13:27.870 --> 13:29.130
I don't know when my power

13:29.790 --> 13:30.610
will come back.

13:40.670 --> 13:42.460
Well, you aren't that bad.

13:42.910 --> 13:44.180
You're quite smart.

13:45.870 --> 13:46.980
You intervened yesterday

13:48.240 --> 13:50.530
because you thought I was Nangong Wan.

13:51.360 --> 13:52.490
Nonetheless, you came to my aid.

13:56.670 --> 13:57.650
I will

13:58.790 --> 13:59.980
repay this favor in the future.

14:03.320 --> 14:04.130
Thank you.

14:23.630 --> 14:24.770
I feel dizzy.

14:30.000 --> 14:31.220
He fainted again?

15:40.320 --> 15:41.130
I'm hungry.

15:41.870 --> 15:42.890
I slept for a few days,

15:43.440 --> 15:44.580
and my tummy is grumbling.

15:45.480 --> 15:47.100
Is there any food here?

15:47.630 --> 15:48.890
It's empty here.

15:49.240 --> 15:50.250
Isn't there anything at all?

15:57.830 --> 15:58.730
Do you

16:00.200 --> 16:01.370
always bring these with you?

16:07.000 --> 16:07.730
Thank you.

16:10.390 --> 16:11.220
I have heard

16:11.550 --> 16:13.300
that there was a gluttonous Core Formation Stage cultivator

16:13.910 --> 16:15.250
who always brought cooking utensils with her.

16:16.390 --> 16:17.850
It's her then?

16:38.080 --> 16:39.700
I'm safe now.

16:41.150 --> 16:42.850
However, my progress has regressed to the Qi Refining Stage.

16:44.240 --> 16:44.940
Regardless,

16:45.320 --> 16:47.610
it complements the Triple Cycle Core Rebirth nicely.

16:48.200 --> 16:49.300
I guess it's meant to be.

16:50.550 --> 16:51.340
Alas,

16:51.600 --> 16:52.940
I have to do the same thing two more times

16:53.750 --> 16:55.180
to reach the Core Formation Stage.

17:25.320 --> 17:26.180
What is

17:26.600 --> 17:27.610
that idiot cooking?

17:27.840 --> 17:28.730
It smells good.

17:30.840 --> 17:32.530
He can cook.

17:45.320 --> 17:46.220
What?

17:46.440 --> 17:47.300
Is he eating alone?

17:50.150 --> 17:51.010
He won't invite me?

18:03.750 --> 18:04.490
Senior Nangong.

18:05.030 --> 18:06.100
This is an invigorating broth

18:06.360 --> 18:07.370
made from spirit water and herbs.

18:07.720 --> 18:08.490
Enjoy while it's warm.

18:27.790 --> 18:28.420
What is this?

18:29.240 --> 18:29.770
Flatbread.

18:31.840 --> 18:32.460
Is it good?

18:33.840 --> 18:34.340
It's my favorite.

18:35.150 --> 18:35.850
I want one too.

18:37.750 --> 18:38.530
I only made one.

18:38.790 --> 18:39.420
Let me have a bite.

19:01.270 --> 19:02.090
The mortals

19:02.590 --> 19:04.090
believe cultivators don't need food.

19:04.680 --> 19:05.660
We only take from nature.

19:06.550 --> 19:07.290
Little do they know,

19:07.480 --> 19:08.570
by combining

19:09.160 --> 19:10.330
matching spirit water and herbs

19:10.960 --> 19:11.980
and cooking them

19:12.110 --> 19:12.980
over low heat,

19:13.310 --> 19:14.420
we make a gourmet meal.

19:14.960 --> 19:16.180
I didn't know you could cook.

19:17.070 --> 19:18.460
You must have cooked a lot.

19:23.350 --> 19:24.700
I'm glad you like it.

19:30.590 --> 19:31.420
Speak.

19:32.270 --> 19:33.570
Why are you here?

19:34.480 --> 19:35.940
What are you going to do next?

19:37.750 --> 19:38.980
If she's not Nangong Wan,

19:39.750 --> 19:40.860
I can't tell her

19:41.640 --> 19:42.810
about the teleport array yet.

19:47.680 --> 19:48.420
Yellow Maple Valley

19:49.640 --> 19:51.090
has fallen into the demonic sects' hands.

19:51.960 --> 19:52.700
I can't return.

19:53.550 --> 19:54.140
Earlier,

19:54.440 --> 19:55.530
I learned that there is

19:55.750 --> 19:56.810
a gem quarry here owned

19:57.200 --> 19:58.090
by the demonic sects.

19:58.480 --> 19:59.290
However, it has weak security.

20:00.550 --> 20:01.090
I wanted

20:01.350 --> 20:02.730
to earn some easy gems

20:03.000 --> 20:03.940
and go somewhere

20:04.720 --> 20:05.810
remote and peaceful

20:05.920 --> 20:06.730
for my cultivating.

20:09.070 --> 20:10.090
But after this debacle,

20:10.510 --> 20:11.250
my progress faded.

20:12.070 --> 20:13.290
I'm afraid my plan will go to waste.

20:15.720 --> 20:17.220
Is he trying to ask a favor from me?

20:18.110 --> 20:18.660
Fine.

20:19.350 --> 20:20.420
He did

20:20.510 --> 20:21.420
help me.

20:21.880 --> 20:22.860
I'll give him a second chance.

20:23.880 --> 20:25.380
While it is indeed easy gems,

20:26.640 --> 20:28.420
we're inside the demonic sects' territory.

20:29.400 --> 20:30.460
You shouldn't take the risk.

20:36.920 --> 20:37.620
You know what?

20:39.030 --> 20:40.330
I can give you two options.

20:40.640 --> 20:41.940
One, I'll give you some gems

20:42.640 --> 20:43.620
and useful resources

20:43.880 --> 20:45.010
to make up for your lost progress

20:45.680 --> 20:47.050
and your timely intervention.

20:49.160 --> 20:49.940
Two...

20:53.200 --> 20:54.620
You come to the Moonshadow Sect with me.

20:57.400 --> 20:58.940
Go to Moonshadow Sect with you?

21:00.200 --> 21:01.290
Don't get the wrong idea.

21:02.510 --> 21:03.250
I'm just thinking

21:03.750 --> 21:04.730
that if you

21:04.920 --> 21:06.290
study under our Core Formation Stage cultivators,

21:07.110 --> 21:08.490
you may recover your progress

21:08.750 --> 21:09.730
faster.

21:10.550 --> 21:11.940
Our sect has a legacy of more than a thousand years.

21:12.200 --> 21:13.180
We have secret arts

21:13.270 --> 21:14.530
that outsiders do not know.

21:15.480 --> 21:16.460
The technique

21:16.720 --> 21:18.220
I used to absorb your power yesterday

21:18.790 --> 21:19.900
is one of them.

21:22.440 --> 21:23.620
Since you've helped me,

21:24.750 --> 21:26.770
I'll put in some good words for you in front of Nangong Wan.

21:27.480 --> 21:28.730
She won't object to this.

21:30.880 --> 21:32.140
One option is so much better than the other.

21:33.270 --> 21:35.290
Does she want me to go with her on purpose?

21:36.750 --> 21:38.380
But to become her subordinate is...

21:45.000 --> 21:45.730
So?

21:46.110 --> 21:47.010
Have you made your decision?

21:51.240 --> 21:51.980
Yes.

21:52.640 --> 21:53.810
I appreciate your offer.

21:54.310 --> 21:55.460
I'm used to autonomy,

21:55.750 --> 21:56.810
so I'll have some gems with me.

21:57.440 --> 21:58.330
As for my progress,

21:59.270 --> 21:59.810
I

22:00.110 --> 22:01.420
will find a way to recover it.

22:02.350 --> 22:03.620
Don't worry.

22:11.240 --> 22:11.940
That's a lot.

22:12.110 --> 22:13.140
She sure

22:13.160 --> 22:14.900
is generous.

22:18.550 --> 22:19.180
All right.

22:20.110 --> 22:22.330
It's too late for you to change your mind.

22:23.310 --> 22:25.290
You've made up your mind.

22:25.920 --> 22:27.090
I don't want to force you.

22:27.880 --> 22:28.700
Just make sure

22:29.590 --> 22:30.860
you won't regret

22:31.510 --> 22:32.530
the decision you made today.

22:34.590 --> 22:35.530
In that case,

22:36.030 --> 22:36.620
I shall

22:37.000 --> 22:38.010
take my leave.

22:41.070 --> 22:41.770
Wait.

22:42.510 --> 22:43.770
You're leaving like this?

22:46.480 --> 22:47.250
Well,

22:48.070 --> 22:49.460
you're weaker now.

22:50.070 --> 22:51.730
You won't be able to fend those demonic cultivators off.

22:53.200 --> 22:54.460
Let me eliminate them first

22:54.830 --> 22:55.620
before you leave.

23:15.550 --> 23:16.420
This array is decent.

23:16.960 --> 23:18.420
You can trap enemies, hide away,

23:18.440 --> 23:19.700
and do many things.

23:20.070 --> 23:21.220
But you need something more offensive.

23:21.640 --> 23:22.490
Thank you for the compliment.

23:23.200 --> 23:24.660
It's made by a friend of mine.

23:30.680 --> 23:31.700
That friend of yours

23:32.550 --> 23:34.770
is probably a woman who hates fighting.

23:39.070 --> 23:39.940
Kid,

23:40.310 --> 23:41.220
I'll leave now.

23:48.480 --> 23:49.380
Qi Refining Stage...

23:50.830 --> 23:52.620
I have no choice but to go somewhere.

24:32.310 --> 24:33.010
Young Master,

24:33.510 --> 24:35.290
the fire in the stove was put out a while ago.

24:35.590 --> 24:37.090
They must be far now.

24:37.510 --> 24:38.490
How annoying.

24:39.350 --> 24:41.220
That woman from Moonshadow Sect

24:41.960 --> 24:43.530
recovered so quickly.

24:49.200 --> 24:50.530
She even

24:51.000 --> 24:52.940
had time to have a meal here.

24:53.400 --> 24:54.770
She's mocking us.

24:54.880 --> 24:55.730
How humiliating.

24:56.920 --> 24:58.330
And I swear I knew

24:58.350 --> 24:59.490
that masked man

24:59.920 --> 25:01.660
who snuck into our team that day from somewhere.

25:02.200 --> 25:02.940
Find out

25:03.270 --> 25:04.460
where he came from.

25:05.640 --> 25:06.220
Young Master,

25:06.830 --> 25:08.220
I observed his technique

25:09.510 --> 25:10.730
but I'm not sure what it was.

25:11.830 --> 25:12.770
It's as if he knows

25:13.070 --> 25:13.940
a bit of everything.

25:14.440 --> 25:15.730
But why did Miss Xuan'er

25:15.750 --> 25:16.490
help them?

25:16.830 --> 25:18.140
Did she

25:18.830 --> 25:19.980
know them?

25:21.790 --> 25:22.420
She

25:22.640 --> 25:23.250
knew them?

25:25.200 --> 25:26.180
Moonshadow Sect.

25:26.720 --> 25:27.730
Yellow Maple Valley.

25:32.680 --> 25:33.490
Could it be

25:35.400 --> 25:36.330
Han Li?

25:37.880 --> 25:38.730
I knew it.

25:39.830 --> 25:40.860
It's him.

25:41.240 --> 25:42.940
That accursed man!

25:48.160 --> 25:48.620
Young Master.

25:49.070 --> 25:49.660
But you said

25:50.110 --> 25:50.530
that

25:51.000 --> 25:52.180
Han Li

25:52.350 --> 25:53.810
had fled.

25:54.110 --> 25:55.290
Why did he come back here?

25:55.680 --> 25:57.290
I should have known

25:57.960 --> 25:59.770
that he was close to that girl

25:59.830 --> 26:01.180
from the Yan Clan Stronghold.

26:01.590 --> 26:04.010
The Moonshadow Sect is meddling in now.

26:05.960 --> 26:07.010
It's been a while.

26:07.400 --> 26:09.140
And he's as cunning as ever,

26:09.680 --> 26:11.220
sneaking around under my nose!

26:20.070 --> 26:21.090
How perceptive of you, Young Master.

26:23.350 --> 26:24.220
Think about it.

26:24.510 --> 26:26.220
He came alone.

26:26.480 --> 26:27.700
It'd be like catching an easy prey.

26:27.960 --> 26:29.490
Congratulations, Young Master. You finally did it.

26:31.270 --> 26:31.570
No,

26:31.880 --> 26:33.380
your dream has finally come true.

26:41.720 --> 26:42.980
He fled

26:43.750 --> 26:45.700
before me today.

26:46.680 --> 26:48.490
Do you find it funny?

26:48.590 --> 26:49.140
No.

26:55.200 --> 26:56.290
Tell everyone

26:57.640 --> 26:58.810
to search for him within 500 li.

26:59.310 --> 27:01.050
Dig deep underground if they have to

27:01.400 --> 27:03.420
but I want him before me!

27:25.160 --> 27:26.700
He has become my inner demon.

27:27.160 --> 27:29.570
I need to torture him,

27:29.920 --> 27:31.730
or I can't have peace of mind.

28:42.240 --> 28:43.330
They won't expect me

28:43.550 --> 28:44.700
to return to where it happened.

28:45.550 --> 28:46.250
Now that

28:46.590 --> 28:47.700
I'm in the Qi Refining Stage,

28:48.550 --> 28:49.900
I need to repair the array quickly

28:50.440 --> 28:51.770
before any undesirable changes take place.

29:04.440 --> 29:05.420
I should make it quick.

29:05.880 --> 29:06.420
Let's go.

31:04.160 --> 31:04.940
It doesn't work.

31:07.270 --> 31:07.770
Perhaps

31:08.310 --> 31:09.290
it lacks charge?

31:15.400 --> 31:16.290
All energy has been drained.

31:18.790 --> 31:20.140
Seems like you have a big appetite too.

31:24.720 --> 31:25.180
Forget it.

31:25.750 --> 31:26.530
It's an emergency.

31:53.240 --> 31:53.700
Young Master,

31:54.000 --> 31:55.290
we have searched everywhere within 500 li.

31:55.510 --> 31:56.730
This quarry is the only place left.

31:57.000 --> 31:57.460
Young Master.

31:58.510 --> 31:58.940
Young Master,

31:59.030 --> 31:59.570
it's him.

31:59.720 --> 32:00.250
He's there.

32:00.750 --> 32:01.730
Han Li!

32:01.880 --> 32:02.250
Young Master.

32:02.790 --> 32:03.660
This is risky.

32:03.920 --> 32:05.090
If I'm not wrong,

32:05.680 --> 32:06.660
that

32:06.830 --> 32:07.860
is an ancient teleport array.

32:09.070 --> 32:09.980
Indeed.

32:11.920 --> 32:13.420
Congratulations, Young Master.

32:13.830 --> 32:15.460
Every sect is coveting

32:15.480 --> 32:16.660
that ancient teleport array.

32:16.960 --> 32:18.180
Offer it to the sect master

32:18.510 --> 32:19.380
and you'll be rewarded.

32:25.480 --> 32:27.180
So he

32:27.440 --> 32:29.250
is a blessing in disguise.

32:30.640 --> 32:31.490
You two.

32:32.400 --> 32:32.980
Go.

32:34.200 --> 32:35.810
Take him down.

32:36.110 --> 32:38.460
Don't damage the teleport array.

32:38.720 --> 32:39.250
Yes.

32:49.960 --> 32:50.570
Qu Hun.

32:58.960 --> 32:59.490
We

33:00.750 --> 33:01.940
are leaving now.

33:16.510 --> 33:17.140
It's him again.

33:26.350 --> 33:27.010
Qu Hun.

33:28.000 --> 33:28.660
Protect the array.

33:41.160 --> 33:41.980
Careful.

33:42.200 --> 33:43.420
Don't damage the array.

33:43.720 --> 33:44.380
Of course.

33:44.590 --> 33:45.620
Core Formation Stage cultivators.

33:58.030 --> 33:58.420
Qu Hun,

33:58.590 --> 33:59.570
offer your energy to the array!

34:06.830 --> 34:07.730
What's taking them so long?

34:07.960 --> 34:08.460
Young Master,

34:08.550 --> 34:09.620
he has an array.

34:10.960 --> 34:11.980
It can take hits

34:12.070 --> 34:14.860
from Core Formation Stage cultivators.

34:16.240 --> 34:17.460
Don't just stand there.

34:17.880 --> 34:18.900
Break the array!

35:01.680 --> 35:02.330
Desperate time

35:02.720 --> 35:03.380
calls for desperate measures.

35:03.790 --> 35:04.460
I'll use everything.

35:12.590 --> 35:13.660
Arrays.

35:14.480 --> 35:15.490
Puppets.

35:17.270 --> 35:19.460
I didn't expect him to have so many tricks.

35:20.030 --> 35:21.770
If he doesn't die,

35:22.960 --> 35:25.180
he'll be a great threat.

35:26.070 --> 35:27.050
Don't hold back.

35:27.350 --> 35:28.570
Break the array immediately!

35:44.190 --> 35:44.780
Qu Hun!

35:45.150 --> 35:45.980
Charge the array!

35:46.960 --> 35:47.780
Why did you stop?

35:49.360 --> 35:50.170
Have we run out of gems?

35:50.960 --> 35:51.900
Have we run out of gems?

35:52.440 --> 35:53.090
Gems...

36:02.030 --> 36:03.010
It's finally moving.

36:40.630 --> 36:41.170
Young Master,

36:41.280 --> 36:42.610
his array can't hold on for much longer.

36:48.550 --> 36:49.940
Han Li,

36:50.800 --> 36:53.090
your journey ends here!

36:55.280 --> 36:55.860
Young Master,

36:56.110 --> 36:56.690
don't damage

36:56.800 --> 36:57.740
the teleport array.

36:57.760 --> 36:58.530
Shut up.

37:00.320 --> 37:02.420
Die!

38:00.920 --> 38:01.580
Teleport!

38:19.790 --> 38:20.380
Azure Drake Banner.

38:20.870 --> 38:21.260
Go!

38:27.700 --> 38:28.660
♪Chasing wind♪

38:28.900 --> 38:31.020
♪I set out afar...♪

38:31.320 --> 38:32.440
Cyan Sword Technique.

38:33.260 --> 38:34.580
♪My voice unheard♪

38:34.780 --> 38:36.620
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

38:36.780 --> 38:37.660
♪Laying low♪

38:37.980 --> 38:39.820
♪I plan every move♪

38:40.260 --> 38:41.780
♪With a mortal heart♪

38:42.180 --> 38:43.500
♪And lingering ties♪

38:43.940 --> 38:45.660
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

38:46.260 --> 38:49.300
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

38:49.740 --> 38:52.820
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

38:54.460 --> 38:57.460
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

38:58.460 --> 39:02.540
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink...♪

39:02.560 --> 39:03.380
This

39:03.990 --> 39:05.260
isn't over yet.

39:06.400 --> 39:07.460
I will be back

39:08.150 --> 39:09.180
one day.

39:10.300 --> 39:12.220
♪As chaos shakes the world♪

39:15.540 --> 39:17.260
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

39:17.620 --> 39:19.020
♪Kind at heart♪

39:19.420 --> 39:20.780
♪Ruthless when I must be♪

39:21.180 --> 39:22.940
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath...♪

39:23.960 --> 39:25.860
Han Li!

39:25.860 --> 39:27.420
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

39:27.700 --> 39:29.540
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

39:33.420 --> 39:34.940
♪Forged by trial♪

39:35.220 --> 39:37.140
♪I rise through three realms♪

39:37.580 --> 39:40.540
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

39:41.020 --> 39:44.540
♪Drunken steps, high song over ocean and mountaintop♪

39:45.540 --> 39:49.020
♪The celestial gourd bears dew, the Golden Core takes shape♪

39:49.900 --> 39:53.700
♪Deep in the night, the crane soars through autumn's clear sky♪

39:54.380 --> 39:56.620
♪Across endless western winds cuts a lone sword, cold and true♪

39:57.060 --> 40:00.940
♪A lone sword, cold and true♪

40:06.220 --> 40:08.060
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

40:08.340 --> 40:09.820
♪I fight alone♪

40:10.020 --> 40:12.020
♪As chaos shakes the world♪

40:15.020 --> 40:16.940
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

40:17.180 --> 40:18.660
♪Kind at heart♪

40:18.940 --> 40:20.460
♪Ruthless when I must be♪

40:20.740 --> 40:22.580
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath...♪

40:24.230 --> 40:25.050
Oh, you old gambler.

40:26.840 --> 40:27.490
Your disciple

40:29.030 --> 40:29.690
has reached heaven.

40:32.220 --> 40:34.220
[Nangong Wan, Hongfu,]

40:34.220 --> 40:36.640
[and other righteous cultivators continue to fight,]

40:36.640 --> 40:38.840
[dampening the invasion]

40:38.840 --> 40:40.140
[of the demonic sects.]

40:40.140 --> 40:43.300
[While Han Li has left the continent he calls home, one day]

40:43.300 --> 40:46.500
[he will return to Tiannan to put an end to the war between good and evil.]

41:03.220 --> 41:06.260
♪That day I first saw you♪

41:06.980 --> 41:09.900
♪We held close, hearts full of joy♪

41:11.540 --> 41:14.620
♪We made a promise to reunite♪

41:15.580 --> 41:18.700
♪And walked into the unknown♪

41:20.220 --> 41:23.020
♪But now that we've met again♪

41:23.580 --> 41:26.660
♪Only silence fills the space as we lock eyes♪

41:28.340 --> 41:31.420
♪We cherished each moment...♪

41:31.590 --> 41:32.610
Is this

41:33.300 --> 41:34.250
the new world?

41:36.540 --> 41:40.780
♪I chase the years, but youth is long gone♪

41:41.140 --> 41:44.820
♪So be it, I set myself free♪

41:45.380 --> 41:48.940
♪To be one standing tall and proud♪

41:49.740 --> 41:53.100
♪Never become a hollow shell...♪

41:53.320 --> 41:54.250
I quite like

41:55.120 --> 41:56.410
the view here.

41:56.740 --> 42:01.300
[End of Season 1]

42:01.860 --> 42:05.460
♪Even as cold winds blow♪

42:06.020 --> 42:08.780
♪Even though it mocks loudly♪

42:09.580 --> 42:13.180
♪We're just fleeting mortals♪

42:13.900 --> 42:17.340
♪Time slipped by before we knew♪

42:17.980 --> 42:21.380
♪Yet we burn that spark of light♪

42:22.100 --> 42:25.500
♪Into this starry sky♪

42:26.180 --> 42:29.620
♪Starlight fades into the Milky Way♪

42:30.180 --> 42:33.740
♪While the mayfly dies in the whirlpool♪

42:34.460 --> 42:37.860
♪Fate raises a toast with song♪

42:38.500 --> 42:42.020
♪Playing the fleeting game of life♪

42:42.540 --> 42:46.180
♪Each step of fate's game unclear♪

42:46.740 --> 42:50.300
♪Who can guess the ending?♪

42:50.820 --> 42:54.340
♪But my heart has never rested♪

42:55.060 --> 42:58.460
♪Ever chasing, still searching on♪

42:59.060 --> 43:02.580
♪Through all the joy and sorrow♪

43:03.380 --> 43:06.660
♪How do I choose the way?♪

43:07.540 --> 43:10.820
♪Now we part, so far apart♪

43:11.700 --> 43:14.940
♪We'll walk our separate paths♪

